s act, and I'd hold its node at prior.\n\nSince the other copy runs on a different input, I'd still hold its node at its prior, and defecting dominates either way, so A-FDT defects. Whether the differing inputs count as reliably equivalent is a judgment call, and the essay's red/blue case treats separate inputs as separate nodes, so I'll read it strictly and submit the letter.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9202,"completion_tokens":923,"total_tokens":10125,"cost":0.055268,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.055268,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.036808,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01846},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":647,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}